OrangeIslands_Kinnow_House1_Text_Grower::
	.string "The island is named for the fruit\n"
	.string "and the fruit is named for\l"
	.string "nothing. It was just here.\p"
	.string "Two groves left. The rest went\n"
	.string "over to the harbour.$"

OrangeIslands_Kinnow_House1_Text_Son::
	.string "Grandad says the boat ruined the\n"
	.string "island.\p"
	.string "I think the boat is the best\n"
	.string "thing that ever happened here.$"

